                                                "sense_id": "bd7ba991-b3b9-313a-a8b1-ea65c4b87145",
                                                "text": "Many a RP podcaster, blogger, and Youtuber have fired up their livesteaming software, to arrogantly beat their chests, boasting that men reach their “peak SMV” (“Sexual Marketplace Value”, or desirability to women) in their late 30s."
                                            }
