                                                "sense_id": "41432054-5ded-3c99-9e3f-f7328b7d6ae2",
                                                "text": "He haughtily demanded the best table, even though people looked and wondered who he was."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e06de36-1e17-4e54-9f36-d1b78d7c05c3",
                                                "sense_id": "41432054-5ded-3c99-9e3f-f7328b7d6ae2",
                                                "text": "\"I don't know what you mean,\" she said haughtily."
                                            }
